      "created_at": "2016-05-08T23:35:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So the end of April saw my son's 16th birthday. I made arrangements and was able to order him the core SotM set. Standard shipping, FedEx. Package was picked up Saturday 30th. Expected delivery to be Friday 5th.</p><p>On Tuesday FedEx transferred the package to USPS in Dallas. On Friday, I checked tracking and there was a delivery exception posted and it was undeliverable for some reason. This was early in the morning, like before deliveries are even made. My son received notice that there was a package for him at the post office. The implication being that where they live the carriers don't deliver packages. So, my son's mother made arrangements to run to the post office on Saturday.</p><p>The f'n post office is closed on Saturdays...</p><p>I am so not impressed.</p>",
